sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Claude
    participant S as MCP server
    participant W as Worker
    participant R as Run store

    C->>S: run_start(fmu, experiment,<br/>start_values, wait_s)
    S->>S: parse modelDescription.xml,<br/>validate names and values
    S->>R: write runs/r12/spec.json (sha256, versions),<br/>status queued, index entry, event
    S-)W: spawn detached<br/>worker for r12
    W->>R: status running<br/>(pid, start time)
    Note over W,R: Heartbeat thread updates<br/>status every 0.5 s
    W->>W: simulate through the engine,<br/>step_finished gate
    W->>R: result.csv, summary.json,<br/>status finished, event
    Note over W,R: log.txt collects worker<br/>output throughout
    alt finished within wait_s
        S-->>C: summary
    else still running
        S-->>C: run id and progress
    end

    C->>S: run_status, run_plot,<br/>run_results(max_points)
    S->>R: read summary.json and result.csv
    S->>S: downsample, render PNG
    S-->>C: compact JSON and PNG
